  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "1.0.0: Initial release. ResilientElasticsearchClient wraps ElasticsearchClient in a Polly v8 ResiliencePipeline. Includes ElasticTransientErrors helper with pre-built ShouldHandle predicate covering 429, 503, 504, and TransportException. Auto-throws ElasticTransientException for retryable HTTP responses. Supports net6.0, net8.0, and net9.0.",
